<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαίρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= sq., 
			Sup.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώταται</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					5.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				293.22
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>
			<i>conveniently</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵδρυται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					9.2.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>important</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ -ώτατα τῆς τέχνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					15.11
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐ</span>. the
				<i>most important persons</i> of the army, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				3.3.11
			</span></i>: c.inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				θεραπεύεσθαι ἐπικαίριοι</span> those whose cure is
				<i>all-important</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. of parts of
			the body, <i>vital</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				102d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
